プの跡が残る、手首と股繩をつなぐの繩を強く引っ張る、猿轡もそのまま)、足(靴)が見えるの全身絵あと後ろ手視点の描写の感じはよろしいですか？\n\nあと彼女の靴は黒ストラップシューズでお願いします。", "nc": 41, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}], "similar_creators": [{"id": 85111, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": true, "acceptable": false, "name": "鰊🔞", "screen_name": "sakana_did", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1354482285043621891/IEWnT2bW.png", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/1142375207518130177/1611768810/1500x500", "appeal_receivable": true, "popular_creator_rank": null, "request_master_rank": null, "first_requester_rank": null, "deleted_at": null, "tip_acceptable_by": "all", "accept_expiration_days": 30, "skills": [{"genre": "correction"}], "nc": 185}, {"id": 212230, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": true, "acceptable": true, "name": "村雲かなた", "screen_name": "mukanata", "avatar_url": "https://proxy.misskeyusercontent.jp/avatar.webp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.misskeyusercontent.jp%2Fio%2F61b6d9a9-e649-4e15-a128-ceb52362b948.webp&avatar=1", "header_url": "https://media.misskeyusercontent.jp/io/f083b206-1571-4303-8532-fcdae080434d.webp", "appeal_receivable": false, "popular_creator_rank": null, "request_master_rank": null, "first_requester_rank": null, "deleted_at": null, "tip_acceptable_by": "all", "accept_expiration_days": 5, "skills": [{"genre": "art"}], "nc": 177}, {"id": 1114332, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": true, "acceptable": true, "name": "𝗞𝗨𝗞𝗜𝗭𝗔𝗞𝗜@Skebリクエスト受付中！", "screen_name": "P_Andromeda_G", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1787106828310269952/oPQUOhX6.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/1319281933650546692/1755606090/1500x500", "appeal_receivable": false, "popular_creator_rank": null, "request_master_rank": null, "first_requester_rank": null, "deleted_at": null, "tip_acceptable_by": "all", "accept_expiration_days": 30, "skills": [{"genre": "art"}, {"genre": "comic"}], "nc": 176}, {"id": 1759983, "creator": true, "n